 "remarks": "A rare opportunity to own a private New Canaan estate where exceptional space, resort-inspired amenities and an unparalleled lifestyle come together. Set on 7.51 private, level acres, this extraordinary estate compound combines a beautifully renovated English manor-style residence with a spectacular, separate European-style pool house.  The 8,572-square-foot main home features gracious proportions, refined architectural details and beautifully updated interiors. An expansive chef's kitchen with breakfast alcove, family room and butler's pantry anchors the home, complemented by a grand living room, elegant dining room, media and game rooms, two offices and inviting gathering spaces. Six bedrooms include a luxurious primary suite, while a newly created guest suite above the three-car garage welcomes visitors.  The remarkable 3,595-square-foot pool house is dedicated to year-round enjoyment, with a heated indoor pool, gym, expansive entertaining areas and a magnificent terrace overlooking the tennis court. Mature landscaping, a picturesque pond, expansive open playing fields, adventure playground and oversized outdoor chess game complete this exceptional retreat.  An extraordinary blend of timeless elegance, modern luxury and resort-inspired living, all within the privacy of your own New Canaan estate. An extraordinary blend of timeless elegance, modern luxury and resort-inspired living, all within the privacy of your own New Canaan estate.",
